      "body": "Confirmed compatibility report submitted: https://github.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/pull/11\n\n- **Status:** boots (title screen renders but is unresponsive to input)\n- **Release:** v0.1.8 (local test build, commit `ee0652347`)\n- **Device:** OnePlus 13 · Snapdragon 8 Elite\n- **Driver:** Turnip gen8 v3 (Mesa 26.3.0-devel, build 9c475fc)\n- **Evidence commit:** `12870c5a1244bf0d758487b1e45e79767499cbf1`\n\n### Screenshots\n\n![SnowRunner — v0.1.8 — boots](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/12870c5a1244bf0d758487b1e45e79767499cbf1/assets/CUSA17425/20260814T110735Z-v0-1-8-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v3-26-3-0-devel/screenshots/01.webp)\n\n![SnowRunner — v0.1.8 — boots](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/12870c5a1244bf0d758487b1e45e79767499cbf1/assets/CUSA17425/20260814T110735Z-v0-1-8-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v3-26-3-0-devel/screenshots/02.webp)\n\n![SnowRunner — v0.1.8 — boots](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JICA98/Bachata-S4-Compatibility/12870c5a1244bf0d758487b1e45e79767499cbf1/assets/CUSA17425/20260814T110735Z-v0-1-8-oneplus-13-snapdragon-8-elite-turnip-gen8-v3-26-3-0-devel/screenshots/03.webp)\n",
